---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Describe a service, method or message, with a request template

Usage: rustman grpc describe [OPTIONS] <TARGET|REQUEST> <SYMBOL>

Arguments:
  <TARGET|REQUEST>
          A target (host:port, grpc://host:port, grpcs://host:port or a {{variable}}), or a grpc request file, its id or its name

  <SYMBOL>
          A service, method (package.Service/Method) or message name

Options:
      --refresh
          Ask the server again instead of using the descriptor cache

      --json
          Print the description as one JSON object

      --env <NAME>
          Environment (default: RUSTMAN_ENV, then default_environment)

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --var <K=V>
          Set a variable, above every other source (repeatable): --var k=v

  -k, --insecure
          Do not verify TLS certificates

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
